\left| \frac{E_{\text{in}} - (E_{\text{out}} + \Delta E_{\text{stored}})}{T \cdot \Delta S_{\text{produced}}} - 1 \right| \le 0.02

6.3 Monte Carlo Gate

1,000 runs, 500 sols, flight‑like Weibull parameters. Mass Closure >0.98 in ≥90% of runs. This probabilistic acceptance criterion is directly aligned with NASA‑STD‑7009B's call for program‑defined acceptance criteria and documented uncertainty quantification.

